@startuml
title 六边形架构 - 依赖倒置

interface UserUseCase
interface UserRepository

["adapter/in Controller"] ..> UserUseCase
["application Service"] ..|> UserUseCase
["Test Mock In"] ..|> UserUseCase

["application Service"] ..> UserRepository
["adapter/out MySQL"] ..|> UserRepository
["adapter/out Mongo"] ..|> UserRepository
["Test Mock Out"] ..|> UserRepository

note bottom of UserRepository
  All layers depend on port (interface)
  not on concrete implementation
end note
@enduml
